{"3360850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Harmony in the Wild", "steam_appid": 3360850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3871000], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/45f6019c9df88de47e5ac644b09a0637.poster.avif?t=1772645165\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/45f6019c9df88de47e5ac644b09a0637.webm?t=1772645165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/45f6019c9df88de47e5ac644b09a0637.mp4?t=1772645165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature's balance lies in the paws of a transforming fox pup.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a magical cozy adventure with open exploration, you learn abilities from animal friends and travel across diverse nature uncovering the mystery of dying nature. <br>The story unfolds through a beautifully handcrafted storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transforming Fox​:</strong> Adapt to your surroundings by transforming into either an arctic fox or a red fox.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong> Explore colorful forests, navigate icy terrains, swim through lakes and ocean to unravel the secrets of a fading ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harmonic String Music:</strong> Experience a calmful and cozy adventure through our original string soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/e0ba8f8c3702673dc34017c11491ec44.poster.avif?t=1772645165\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/e0ba8f8c3702673dc34017c11491ec44.webm?t=1772645165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/e0ba8f8c3702673dc34017c11491ec44.mp4?t=1772645165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Abilities​:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gliding, Swimming, Freezing, Charge Jump, Rock smashing, Telegrab and more!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Restoration: </strong>Witness the color and vibrancy return  to the world as you progress within the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storybook</strong>: Immerse yourself in a narrative told through a beautifully illustrated storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/7403a89873f522d2752486000b346ce8.poster.avif?t=1772645165\" width=608 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/7403a89873f522d2752486000b346ce8.webm?t=1772645165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/7403a89873f522d2752486000b346ce8.mp4?t=1772645165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Started as a passionate student project in Finland, Harmony in the Wild grew beyond our dreams and inspired us to form our own indie studio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for joining us on this adventure.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/45f6019c9df88de47e5ac644b09a0637.poster.avif?t=1772645165\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/45f6019c9df88de47e5ac644b09a0637.webm?t=1772645165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/45f6019c9df88de47e5ac644b09a0637.mp4?t=1772645165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature's balance lies in the paws of a transforming fox pup.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a magical cozy adventure with open exploration, you learn abilities from animal friends and travel across diverse nature uncovering the mystery of dying nature. <br>The story unfolds through a beautifully handcrafted storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transforming Fox​:</strong> Adapt to your surroundings by transforming into either an arctic fox or a red fox.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong> Explore colorful forests, navigate icy terrains, swim through lakes and ocean to unravel the secrets of a fading ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harmonic String Music:</str